# Purpose
# Serve the built _site folder on localhost.
#
# Common usage
# Run from the repository root.
# .\scripts\serve-pages.ps1
# .\scripts\serve-pages.ps1 -Port 4000
# .\scripts\serve-pages.ps1 -Port 4001 -BindAddress 127.0.0.1
# .\scripts\serve-pages.ps1 -SkipBuild -Port 4000
#
# Useful options
# -Port chooses the localhost port.
# -BindAddress chooses the local bind address.
# -SkipBuild serves the current _site folder without rebuilding.
#
# Recommended next command
# Open http://127.0.0.1:4000 in the browser.
#
# Notes
# This command keeps running until you stop it.
# Use pages-local.ps1 -Mode Serve for the wrapper version.
